GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/a-young-kendrick-lamar-fan-just-got-the-best-birthday-ever-following-harrowing-tragedy/</guid></item><item><title>重金属主唱暂停了他成立 20 年后创立的格莱美获奖乐队：“我筋疲力尽了”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/heavy-metal-frontman-hits-pause-on-grammy-winning-band-he-founded-after-20-years-im-exhausted/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;幽灵主唱托拜厄斯·福吉透露，如果他目前的中断是乐队的“结局”，他对乐队所取得的成就感到满意。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;后&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/heavy-metal-frontman-hits-pause-on-grammy-winning-band-he-founded-after-20-years-im-exhausted/"&gt;重金属主唱在格莱美获奖乐队 20 年后暂停：“我精疲力竭”&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:35:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/heavy-metal-frontman-hits-pause-on-grammy-winning-band-he-founded-after-20-years-im-exhausted/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿的姐姐透露乡村偶像愿意接受实验药物作为帮助他人的最后方法</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/dolly-partons-sister-reveals-country-icon-offered-to-take-experimental-medication-as-a-final-way-to-help-others/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;斯特拉·帕顿（Stella Parton）敦促那些悲伤的人通过表现出善意并投入时间和资源来支持他人，以纪念多莉的遗产。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.vice.com/en/article/dolly-partons-sister-reveals-country-icon-offered-to-take-experimental-medication-as-a-final-way-to-help-others/"&gt;多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 的姐姐透露乡村偶像愿意接受实验性药物治疗作为帮助他人的最后途径，&lt;/a&gt;这篇文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.vice.com"&gt;VICE&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 19:29:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.vice.com/en/article/dolly-partons-sister-reveals-country-icon-offered-to-take-experimental-medication-as-a-final-way-to-help-others/</guid></item><item><title>吉姆·琼斯发誓不再与这位纽约传奇人物合作：“收拾他”</title><link>https://www.vice.com/en/article/jim-jones-vows-to-never-work-with-this-new-york-legend-ever-again-pack-him-up/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;吉姆·琼斯与许多不同的艺术家都有不和。但他发誓